 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "E, Shanai System Subete Wan'ope shiteiru Watashi wo Kaiko desu ka?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "え、社内システム全てワンオペしている私を解雇ですか？（コミック）"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "E, Shanai System Subete OneOpe shiteiru Watashi o Kaiko Desu ka?"
   },
   {
    "en": "Eh, Are You Seriously Going to Fire Me When I've been Handling the Company's In-House System as a One-Man Show?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Satou Ai who has been handling the company's in-house system as a one-man show, has received a notice of dismissal upon a change in president. After the dismissal, Ai was alone in deep sorrows until she stumbled upon Suzuki Kenta. Kenta invites her to join his startup company. The company was something he started to get close to others with the name, \"True programmer's cram school\" with Ai's unconventional, daring and sometimes wild lectures, the student started to look forward to the lessons.",
   "ja": "社内システムをワンオペしていた佐藤愛は、社長交代を機に解雇予告を受ける。退職後、ファミレスでひとり悲しみに暮れていた愛は、幼馴染の鈴木健太と再会する。そして健太は彼女を自らのスタートアップに招待した。相手の心に寄り添うために始めた事業、その名は「真のプログラマ塾」。佐藤愛の熱く、時に破天荒な講義で受講生たちは少しだけ前を向く。"
  },
